stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DRAFT
  DRAFT --> VALIDATED: schema and semantic checks
  VALIDATED --> STAGED: binding/fixtures/policy approved
  STAGED --> ENABLED: required assurance evidence
  ENABLED --> DEPRECATED: replaced, existing work drained
  ENABLED --> DISABLED: operator or safety rollback
  DEPRECATED --> DISABLED: no active work
  DISABLED --> STAGED: corrected candidate and reevaluation
